WEBVTT

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.920
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.720
Whoa! It's raining cats
and dogs out there!

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.440
I hope they make it back
all right.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.680
-Heads up! Andy's coming!
-(JESSIE GASPS)

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.360
ANDY'S MOM:
Andy, time for dinner.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.840
Yes! I'm starving!

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.120
ANDY'S MOM: Don't forget
to wash your hands!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:10.400
ANDY: Okay, Mom!

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.520
(GASPS)

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.640
(REX SHRIEKS)

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.920
BUZZ: Do you see him?
WOODY: No.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:17.240
Well, he's done for.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.480
He'll be lost! Forever!

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.320
Jessie. Buzz. Slink.
Molly's room.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.640
The rest of you, stay put.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.960
(GRUNTS) Bo!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.240
-(SHEEP BLEATING)
-Situation?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.320
Lost toy. Side yard.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.680
Billy. Goat. Gruff.
Raise the blinds.

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.120
(BLEATING)

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.760
They have names?
You never told me that.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.880
You never asked.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.840
Where is he?

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:57.360
(THUNDER CRASHING)

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.480
WOODY: There!

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.560
BUZZ: How do we reach him?

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.080
BOTH: Operation Pull-Toy!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.720
-Slink!
-You got it, Woody!

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.320
Barbies!

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:12.960
Go!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.640
(WIND BLOWING)

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:20.320
BO PEEP: Flashlight.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.520
(WHIRRING)

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.440
Hang on, R.C.!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.080
(GASPS, GRUNTS)

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.360
-I ain't got any more slink!
-(GRUNTING)

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.560
-(BO PEEP GASPS)
-(STRAINING)

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.800
(WOODY PANTING)

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.640
(MONKEYS SCREAMING)

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.280
(GASPS)

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.920
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.040
-(SWITCH CLICKS)
-(BO PEEP GASPS)

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.680
(GRUNTING)

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.200
MAN: Oh, it's beautiful.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:29.280
ANDY'S MOM: I'm so glad to see

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.760
this old lamp
go to a good home.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.400
We've had it since
Molly was a baby.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.360
Molly, are you sure
it's all right?

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.760
MOLLY: Yeah,
I don't want it anymore.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.200
MAN: Thank you.

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.280
Where's Woody?

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.280
(GROANS)

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.720
(KNOCKS ON DOOR)

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.640
MAN: Yeah, hi.
I think I left my keys here.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.320
-(BO PEEP GASPS)
-(PANTING)

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.440
-Woody.
-Quick!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.200
We'll sneak in the hedges
before he's back.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.200
Woody, it's okay.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.440
What? No! No, no, no.
You can't go!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.640
What's best for Andy
is that...

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.840
Woody.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.680
I'm not Andy's toy.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.000
(STAMMERS) What?

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.960
It's time for the next kid.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.720
MAN: Oh, and thank you again
for everything.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:16.880
I really appreciate it.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.280
ANDY'S MOM: Oh, my pleasure.
I'm glad it all worked out.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.600
You know, kids lose
their toys every day.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.320
Sometimes they get
left in the yard...

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.280
or put in the wrong box.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:39.440
And that box gets taken away.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.760
ANDY: Mom, where's Woody?

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.480
ANDY'S MOM: Andy! Come inside!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.600
ANDY: I can't find Woody!

